    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Applicable transaction fees charged by HKEX, HKSFC, Computershare and stamp duty charged by the Hong&#160;Kong government</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top; ">
