    <td style="white-space: nowrap">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
    <td style="white-space: nowrap; text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="padding-left: 9pt; text-indent: -9pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Shanghai-Hong&#160;Kong Stock Connect Stocks</b></span></td>
    <td style="white-space: nowrap">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Commissions</b>: 0.01% of the transaction amount, subject to a minimum charge of RMB5 (US $0.7) per transaction</span></td>
    <td style="white-space: nowrap; text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Applicable transaction fees charged by SSE, CSRC, Hong&#160;Kong and PRC clearing agencies, and stamp tax charged by the PRC government</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top; ">
    <td style="padding-left: 9pt; text-indent: -9pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="white-space: nowrap">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
    <td style="white-space: nowrap; text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
