commitments as of December 31, 2025. Our lease obligations primarily comprise future aggregate minimum lease payments in respect of office
premises under non-cancellable lease agreements.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

