    <td style="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
    <td style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td>
    <td style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Any cash distribution to ADS holders</span></td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="vertical-align: top; padding-left: 9pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -9pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
    <td style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
    <td style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="vertical-align: top; padding-left: 9pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -9pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>A fee equivalent to the fee that would be payable if securities distributed to you had been Class A ordinary shares and the Class A ordinary shares had been deposited for issuance of ADSs</b></span></td>
    <td style="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: justify">&#160;</td>
