    <td style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Distribution of securities distributed to holders of deposited securities (including rights) that are distributed by the depositary to ADS holders</span></td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="vertical-align: top; padding-left: 9pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -9pt">&#160;</td>
