  <tr style="vertical-align: top; ">
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>2.22</b></span></td>
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify"><a href="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1806524/000121390025007576/ea022863201ex4-1_liongroup.htm"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Form of Series K American Depositary Shares Purchase Warrant (incorporated by reference to Exhibit 4.1 of Registrant&#8217;s Form 6-K filed on January 28, 2025)</span></a></td></tr>

<tr style="vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
