</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="text-transform: uppercase"><b>CONSOLIDATED
STATEMENTS OF COMPREHENSIVE LOSS</b></span></p><div>

