December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively and under Share Incentive Plan in the amount of $214,893, $573,264 and&#160;$1,292,083
for the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively.</span></ix:footnote></td>
</tr></table><div>
