</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><b>NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Note 2 &#8212; Significant Accounting Policies</b>
(cont.)</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Loss per Ordinary Share (&#8220;EPS&#8221;)</b>
(cont.)</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="_SignificantAccountingPoliciesTextBlock-c0_cont_7" id="_SignificantAccountingPoliciesTextBlock-c0_cont_6"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfAntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareTextBlock" id="ixv-20331"><ix:continuation continuedAt="_EarningsPerSharePolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_6" id="_EarningsPerSharePolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_5"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">For the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and
2023, the following potential dilutive securities denominated in ordinary shares equivalents were excluded for the periods they were outstanding
from the computation of diluted earnings loss per share because to do so would have been antidilutive. As a result, diluted loss per ordinary
share is the same as basic loss per ordinary share for all periods presented.&#160;</p></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

