</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="_IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_2" id="_IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">We applied ASU 2023-09 on a prospective basis.
Accordingly, the disaggregation of rate reconciliation categories in the table below provide the disclosures required by ASU 2023-09 for
the year ended December 31, 2025. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_ScheduleOfEffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfEffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationTableTextBlock" id="ixv-28148">The reconciliation of the U.S. federal statutory income tax rate to the 2025 effective income tax rate
was as follows:</ix:nonNumeric></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

