<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">For the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and
2023, the Group incurred operating lease expense of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-28218">106,715</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c11" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-28219">532,144</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c10" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-28220">594,228</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

